From 175981457280c913fc9e3ab073bdb55918da7bf0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 17:32:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] CrewCloud: mobile-first look, navigation, home and setup
 guide

- Own theme (pink-purple brand, Nunito/Fredoka fonts), 16px type and 44px touch targets on phones; dark mode follows the brand.
- Phones get a bottom tab bar (Home, Tonies, Add audio, Boxes, More), a compact section bar with a Pages sheet instead of nested drawers, and notifications above the tab bar. Header: logo + CrewCloud, status dot, bell.
- Home is task-first: setup progress card, one big Add audio button, shortcut tiles, your tonies and boxes, help links.
- New /setup guide: 5 steps worked out from real server state (box connected, tonie seen, audio in the library, tonie playing it), with the box-registration switch and recommended settings in place.
- Tonies list shows two per row on phones.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
